  nesnd_cne_urban_journal:0 "Building an Urban Nation"
  nesnd_cne_urban_journal_reason:0 "People leaving the estates need work in workshops, mines and towns. Iron and coal must support steel, tools and engines, while welfare helps workers endure unemployment, sickness and old age. This urban society challenges the authority of the old rural schools and scholars."
  nesnd_cne_urban_start_button:0 "Begin building an urban nation"
