+ nesnd_cne_camps_status:0 "States reorganising military estates: #v [ROOT.GetCountry.MakeScope.Var('nesnd_cne_camps_active').GetValue|0]#!."
+ nesnd_cne_start_requirements:0 "Land reform remains active; nonnegative bureaucracy, no bankruptcy penalty, disorder below 65, and ownership of the state."
  nesnd_cne_land_requirements:0 "Research Intensive Agriculture; developed agricultural land must occupy at least #v 6%#! of arable capacity in the reform regions; non-negative bureaucracy, no bankruptcy, disorder below #v 65#!."
  nesnd_cne_urban_requirements:0 "At least #v 5#! states with level-#v 5#! urban centres; iron mines #v 25#!, coal mines #v 40#!, steel mills #v 10#!, tooling workshops #v 30#!, motor industries #v 6#!, logging camps #v 60#!, shipyards #v 12#! levels.\nUnlock welfare technology, enact Poor Laws, Wage Subsidies or Old Age Pension, and fund Social Security to level #v 1#!; non-negative bureaucracy, no bankruptcy, disorder below #v 65#!."
- nesnd_cne_land_start_tt:0 "Monthly reform progress #p +0.25#!. Landowners approval #n −2#!, Rural Folk approval #n −1#!; Landowners attraction #n −15%#!, Industrialists attraction #p +15%#! without approval gain. Enactment success #p +5 percentage points#! and minimum wage #p +5%#!."
- nesnd_cne_urban_start_tt:0 "Monthly reform progress #p +0.35#!. Devout approval #n −2#!, Industrialists approval #n −1#!; Petite Bourgeoisie attraction #p +15%#!. Enactment success #p +5 percentage points#! and minimum wage #p +5%#!."
