- nesnd_cne_funding.1.d:0 "[SCOPE.sState('nesnd_cne_funding_state').GetName] faces the pressures of economic transition. Funding workshops and technical education will improve construction, qualifications and education for one year. Actual hiring still depends on viable enterprises and workers finding suitable jobs."
+ nesnd_cne_funding.1.d:0 "Officials in [SCOPE.sState('nesnd_cne_funding_state').GetName] report growing numbers of peasants leaving the estates without the skills required by workshops. They request funds for technical schools and industrial expansion to help these people find work in town."
