- nesnd_cne_funding.2.d:0 "Relief offices in [SCOPE.sState('nesnd_cne_funding_state').GetName] request additional funds. Families without income are cutting their meals while they search for work. One year of additional welfare can ease this transition; lasting livelihoods still require productive employment and wages."
+ nesnd_cne_funding.2.d:0 "Relief offices in [SCOPE.sState('nesnd_cne_funding_state').GetName] request additional funds. Families without an income are cutting their meals, and employers have not yet absorbed them. The court must decide whether to grant a year of additional relief."
